<div id="{{ prefix }}-section-{{ index }}">
    <h3>Filter by Taxonomy</h3>
    <div class="accordion-content">
        <div>
            {% if filter_by_taxonomy_info %}<p>{{ filter_by_taxonomy_info_content }}</p>{% endif %}
            <p>From preselected conditions, the user can select "Bacteria, Archaea, Fungi", "Eukaryota, no Fungi", "Fungi", "Viruses", "Bacteria", "Eukaryota", or "Archaea" to restrict the retrieved sequences to these taxonomy groups.</p>
            <p>"Bacteria, Archaea, Fungi", "Bacteria", "Archaea", and "Fungi" select organisms that may provide genome context (gene clusters/operons) useful for inferring functions.</p>
            <p>The UniProt IDs also can be restricted to taxonomy categories within the Superkingdom, Kingdom, Phylum, Class, Order, Family, Genus, and Species ranks. Multiple conditions are combined to be a union of each other.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            Preselected conditions:
            <select id="{{ prefix }}-taxonomy-select" data-option-id="{{ prefix }}-tax-data">
                <option disabled selected value="">-- select a preset to auto populate --</option>
                <option value="bacteria_fungi">Bacteria, Archaea, Fungi</option>
                <option value="eukaroyta_no_fungi">Eukaryota, no Fungi</option>
                <option value="fungi">Fungi</option>
                <option value="viruses">Viruses</option>
                <option value="bacteria">Bacteria</option>
                <option value="eukaryota">Eukaryota</option>
                <option value="archaea">Archaea</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        {# Base Template for Autopopulate Taxonomy Item #}
        {# Connects with taxonomy_filter.js for dinamic functionality #}
        <div id="{{ prefix }}-taxonomy-container" data-prefix="{{ prefix }}"></div>
        <div style="display: none">
            <input type="hidden" name="{{ prefix }}-taxonomy-preset-name" id="{{ prefix }}-taxonomy-preset-name" value="" />
        </div>
        <div>
            <button type="button" class="light add-tax-btn" data-option-id="{{ prefix }}-tax-data" id="{{ prefix }}-taxonomy-add-btn">
                Add Taxonomy Category
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>